%% Token streaming: the stream_tokens seam, its consumers, cancel semantics.
%% Drawn 2026-08-19 from nollama.py @ 85e796f.
%% Updated 2026-08-30: stream_vlm_tokens seam, shared _sse_stream, _ThinkSplitter/_ToolCallGate (issue #36).
%% Updated 2026-09-01: _vlm_penalty_guard one-shot retry on the image path.
%% Updated 2026-09-01: _reset_vlm_state on the VLM throw path (issue #24).
%% Updated 2026-09-11: per-request cancel token replaces the shared slot flag (issue #40).
%% Updated 2026-09-13: _note_poisoned reached from the non-streaming generates too,
%%   and it now short-circuits _reset_vlm_state (issue #38).
%% Legend: solid = normal path, dashed = failure/timeout/cancel paths,
%%         ALL-CAPS nodes = prose annotations.
%% Palette: route (blue) = protocol consumers, gen (green) = backend/worker,
%%          client (yellow) = wire frames, warn (orange) = annotations.
%% Updated 2026-09-18: VLM slots get the no-think switch too, via a pre-rendered prompt.
%% covers: nollama.py:_apply_tuning,_tuning_for,_model_family,_apply_thinking_switch,_no_think_requested,_nothink_render_ok,render_nothink_prompt,preseeded_for,stream_tokens,stream_vlm_tokens,_reset_vlm_state,_vlm_penalty_guard,_is_placeholder_bounds_error,_note_poisoned,_is_poisoned_context_error,stream_llm,stream_vlm,_sse_stream,_ollama_stream_chat,_ollama_stream_generate,generate_llm,generate_vlm,cancel,explain_genai_error,_AtemStreamFilter,_AtemPlainFilter,_ThinkSplitter,_split_think,_ToolCallGate,_prompt_preseeds_think,_pythonic_calls,_strip_tool_markup
flowchart TB
  stream_tokens["DeviceSlot.stream_tokens<br/>SEAM between backend and protocol.<br/>Owns: worker thread, lock, binding the<br/>caller's per-request cancel token to<br/>slot._cancel INSIDE the lock, _stream_error.<br/>A token already set at lock time skips<br/>generate (client left while queued).<br/>Yields str chunk, or None after
  'heartbeat' quiet seconds"]
  worker["worker thread:<br/>pipe.generate(history, gen, streamer_callback)<br/>tokens -> Queue; sentinel None in finally"]
  opt_stream_tokens["OptimumSlot.stream_tokens<br/>same contract over transformers<br/>TextIteratorStreamer; ATEM markers kept<br/>visible for _AtemStreamFilter"]
  stream_vlm_tokens["DeviceSlot.stream_vlm_tokens<br/>VLM twin of the seam: VLMPipeline takes<br/>prompt+images, not ChatHistory; runs<br/>_AtemPlainFilter before yielding; same<br/>None heartbeats (the old 180s silent<br/>abort in stream_vlm is gone)"]

  stream_tokens --> think_switch
  think_switch["_apply_thinking_switch<br/>ChatHistory.set_extra_context(<br/>enable_thinking=false) when the UI's<br/>no-think prose is in a SYSTEM message"]
  think_switch --> apply_tuning
  apply_tuning["_apply_tuning<br/>clamp to the FAMILY's measured limits<br/>(model-tuning.json, keyed on config.json<br/>model_type). Only ever LOWERS."]
  apply_tuning --> worker
  stream_vlm_tokens --> vlm_think_switch
  vlm_think_switch["render_nothink_prompt (handler, text-only turns)<br/>Tokenizer.apply_chat_template(raw_messages,<br/>extra_context enable_thinking=false), passed<br/>as raw_prompt=True so the seam sets<br/>gen.apply_chat_template=False. Armed at load<br/>by _nothink_render_ok only if a dummy render<br/>ends in a CLOSED block. preseeded_for() tells<br/>the splitter which tail this turn has.<br/>generate_vlm takes the same path"]
  vlm_think_switch --> worker

  penalty_guard["_vlm_penalty_guard (image turns only)<br/>Some VLM exports put image placeholders<br/>outside 0..vocab_size. genai's repetition<br/>-penalty transformer walks the PROMPT ids<br/>and asserts on them, so every image turn died<br/>while text turns worked. First failure sets a<br/>per-slot flag, warns once, and retries with<br/>repetition_penalty = 1.0; later image turns<br/>skip the penalty up front. Text turns keep it"]
  reset_state["_reset_vlm_state<br/>on a throwing VLM generate, once the poisoned<br/>class is ruled out: finish_chat() to reconverge<br/>the attention mask with tokenized_history, so one<br/>failure does not wedge every later request"]
  poison_gate{"_is_poisoned_context_error<br/>checked BEFORE any recovery"}
  worker -.->|"VLM generate throws"| poison_gate
  poison_gate -.->|"CL_OUT_OF_RESOURCES"| poisoned
  poison_gate -.->|"anything else"| reset_state
  reset_state -.->|"image turn asserted:<br/>prompt_id out of bounds"| penalty_guard
  reset_state -.->|"anything else"| _stream_error
  penalty_guard -.->|"retry once, penalty cleared"| worker

  RETRYSAFE["THE RETRY IS SAFE TO REPLAY: the assertion fires in the sampler
  BEFORE any token reaches streamer_callback, so the consumer has seen
  nothing to un-send. That is what makes one-shot retry viable on a
  streaming seam at all. Cost is one re-prefill, once per load.
  Observed on Arc 140T, 140V and Arc Pro B60, genai 2026.3 and 2026.5."]
  penalty_guard -.-> RETRYSAFE

  WEDGEUNPROVEN["THE RESET IS DEFENSIVE, NOT A VERIFIED FIX. The wedge it
  targets - every later request dying on 'Prompt ids size is less than
  tokenized history size' - is a USER REPORT (Arc 140T, issue #24), and the
  claim that finish_chat() reconverges the state is INFERRED from the genai
  source. A bare-genai probe on a 140V could not wedge the pipeline at all:
  a sampler-stage throw left it usable for two later requests, with and
  without finish_chat. That throw fires AFTER prefill; the reporter's fires
  inside it, and a 27.2 GB per-allocation cap puts the real repro out of
  reach without a ~165k-token prompt. What IS observed: calling it on a
  healthy pipe costs nothing. Note finish_chat() is deprecated in genai
  2026.3 and needs rewriting before it is removed.
  WHAT IT CANNOT DO (observed 2026-09-12, issue #38): rescue a slot after
  CL_OUT_OF_RESOURCES - the driver context is gone; the reporter needed a
  process restart, once a reboot. _note_poisoned takes that slot out of
  service (status error, reason in /health) instead of pretending.
  AND IT MUST NOT RUN ON THAT CLASS AT ALL: finish_chat() is an OpenCL
  call, which is exactly what OpenVINO's error text says may hang after
  this error - hence the poison gate ahead of it."]
  reset_state -.-> WEDGEUNPROVEN
  poisoned["_note_poisoned<br/>CL_OUT_OF_RESOURCES only:<br/>status = error, reason set,<br/>_slot_serviceable routes around it,<br/>and _idle_watchdog leaves it alone<br/>(slot-lifecycle.mmd)"]
  _stream_error -.->|"_is_poisoned_context_error"| poisoned

  nonstream["non-streaming generates<br/>DeviceSlot.generate_vlm / generate_llm<br/>and OptimumSlot.stream_tokens"]
  nonstream -.->|"backend exception"| poisoned

  EVERYPATH["EVERY GENERATE PATH CALLS _note_poisoned, streaming or not.
  Until 2026-09-13 only the two genai streaming handlers did, so a
  non-streaming VLM request that poisoned the context left the slot
  'ready' - and a ready slot is what _idle_watchdog unloads, which
  aborts the PROCESS rather than the request (observed 2026-09-12,
  Arc 140T, issue #38: 'Fatal Python error: Aborted', current thread
  _idle_watchdog inside unload()). A new catch site that re-raises
  without calling this re-opens that abort."]
  nonstream -.-> EVERYPATH
  worker -.->|"backend exception"| _stream_error["_stream_error set;<br/>explain_genai_error names the fix<br/>(KV pool too small, NPU compiler,<br/>AUTO_DETECT -> --npu-platform, and the<br/>per-allocation cap: a perfect-square<br/>'requested N bytes' is named as an S-squared<br/>attention mask, i.e. a prompt-length limit).<br/>Order matters: the specific matchers run<br/>before the broad 'Compilation failed' one,<br/>and the NPU hints are gated on the slot's<br/>device — see tests/test_npu_pin.py"]

  _sse_stream["_sse_stream (OpenAI SSE, shared body)<br/>None -> empty-content delta keepalive;<br/>first token stamps wall-clock TTFT;<br/>finish stop / cancelled / error, [DONE]"]
  stream_llm["stream_llm / stream_vlm<br/>thin wrappers: pick the seam,<br/>delegate to _sse_stream"]
  tool_stream["_sse_tool_stream (request-flow.mmd)<br/>same frames, plus _ToolCallGate<br/>and tool_calls deltas at the end"]
  _ollama_stream_chat["_ollama_stream_chat (ndjson)<br/>None after 120s ABORTS<br/>(historical no-token timeout);<br/>think stays inside content"]
  _ollama_stream_generate["_ollama_stream_generate (ndjson)<br/>same abort; no TTFT"]
  generate_llm["generate_llm (OptimumSlot)<br/>non-streaming = joined stream,<br/>heartbeat=None blocks forever"]

  stream_tokens --> _sse_stream
  stream_vlm_tokens --> _sse_stream
  _sse_stream --> stream_llm
  stream_tokens --> tool_stream
  stream_vlm_tokens --> tool_stream
  stream_tokens --> _ollama_stream_chat
  stream_tokens --> _ollama_stream_generate
  opt_stream_tokens --> generate_llm

  splitter["_ThinkSplitter / _split_think<br/>think spans -> reasoning_content deltas,<br/>answer -> content; tag prefixes held back<br/>across chunk boundaries; empty block dropped.<br/>_prompt_preseeds_think (at load, via the<br/>pipeline's own tokenizer) starts it inside a<br/>block for templates that open think themselves.<br/>--think-in-content restores the old shape"]
  gate["_ToolCallGate<br/>content streams until a tool-call opener<br/>(any syntax parse_tool_calls knows, incl.<br/>LFM2.5 &lt;|tool_call_start|&gt;);<br/>held from there, parsed at the end"]
  gate --> scrub["_strip_tool_markup<br/>held text that parsed to NO call still<br/>reaches the user: markers out, prose kept<br/>(a bare &lt;tool_call&gt; was rendered, 2026-09-23)"]
  gate --> pyc["_pythonic_calls<br/>LFM2.5 writes a PYTHON LIST of calls;<br/>ast.parse, never eval, literals only"]
  _sse_stream --> splitter
  tool_stream --> splitter
  tool_stream --> gate

  atem["_AtemStreamFilter / _AtemPlainFilter<br/>Glimmer channel routing -> think tags.<br/>StreamFilter keys on live markers<br/>(optimum path keeps special tokens);<br/>PlainFilter keys on detokenized<br/>'to=self' / 'assistant to=user' text<br/>(GenAI strips the markers)"]
  stream_vlm_tokens --> atem
  opt_stream_tokens --> atem
  atem --> splitter

  cancel["cancel (/v1/cancel) / client disconnect<br/>sets a token -> streamer_callback<br/>returns True -> generation stops.<br/>slot.cancel() sets slot._cancel = the<br/>ACTIVE request's token; a consumer's<br/>finally sets ITS OWN token"]
  _sse_stream -.-> cancel
  tool_stream -.-> cancel
  _ollama_stream_chat -.-> cancel
  _ollama_stream_generate -.-> cancel

  FINALLY["THE CANCEL SAFETY NET LIVES IN THE CONSUMERS, NOT THE SEAM:
  each consumer's finally sets its own token so a client disconnect
  stops generation. It cannot move into stream_tokens - a generator's
  finally also runs on normal exhaustion, which would make the
  consumer's was_cancelled read True on every completed stream.
  WHY THE TOKEN IS PER REQUEST (issue #40, observed 2026-09-11): with
  one shared flag, request A's finally runs AFTER A's worker released
  the lock; queued request B has already taken the lock and cleared
  the flag, so A's stale set() cancels B at its first token. Every
  agent client overlaps requests (OpenCode fires a title request beside
  each turn), so this fired on every turn. 'Clear inside the lock' -
  the previous defence - assumed the opposite ordering. See TODONT."]
  cancel -.-> FINALLY

  CANCELLIMIT["Cancel relies on OpenVINO invoking the streamer callback.
  A blocked prefill never yields, so cancel cannot take effect until
  prefill ends - an aborted client leaves the generation churning.
  This is why keepalive (not abort-and-retry) is the strategy for
  slow prefills."]
  cancel -.-> CANCELLIMIT

  ORDER["FILTER ORDER IS FIXED: ATEM (channel markers -> think tags)
  runs inside the VLM/optimum seams, the splitter keys on the tags it
  produces, and the gate only ever sees answer text - tool openers
  inside a think span are reasoning, not calls."]
  splitter -.-> ORDER

  NOTHINK["PROSE CANNOT TURN THINKING OFF. A template that already emitted
  '&lt;think&gt;' opened the channel before the model wrote a token, so an
  instruction only buys a shorter ramble - Qwen3.8 was seen answering
  'Constraint 3: Reasoning strength: minimal' from INSIDE its reasoning.
  enable_thinking=false forecloses it structurally. Worst on a SIDE-REQUEST:
  a thinking model on a small budget returns EMPTY content - SmolLM3-3B on
  NPU 4 did that for OpenCode's title, 3/3 deterministic (TODO.md).
  The prose is left in the history anyway: for Muse Glimmer it IS the
  native control. THE VLM PATH HAS NO ChatHistory HOOK - VLMPipeline takes
  a flattened prompt string - so the handler renders the prompt itself with
  the same extra_context (vlm_think_switch). VLMPipeline.set_chat_template
  was tried first and throws 'Chat mode is not supported' on the
  prefix-caching backend. Before the fix, Qwen3.8-27B on a B60 VLM slot
  spent a 600-token 'no-think' story budget entirely inside think and
  returned empty content (2026-09-18, scripts/bonsai-bench.py)."]
  think_switch -.-> NOTHINK
  vlm_think_switch -.-> NOTHINK

  TUNING["THE CALLER IS OFTEN US. The web UI sent repetition_penalty 1.1 to
  every model for three months to break thinking-loops on one of them, and it
  silently destroyed the Phi-3 family on long output - bad text raises
  nothing, so nobody found it until a human read the output. A ceiling
  enforced at the SERVER holds whichever surface asks. Keyed on model_type
  from config.json: intrinsic, so renaming a model cannot change its tuning,
  and family-level, which is how these failures cluster. phi3 and phi3_v are
  DIFFERENT families and both have entries."]
  apply_tuning -.-> TUNING

